  "doubts": "Start ref F1 is the only road end at the Routeburn end, but it is where the Routeburn Nature Walk (not the Routeburn Track) meets Routeburn Road; I take it as the Routeburn Shelter trailhead. The page says the track can be walked in either direction; the main way follows the order the page describes (Routeburn Shelter to The Divide), and The Divide Shelter is listed as the other access end. The circuit via the Greenstone and Caples Tracks is an extension onto another walk, not recorded as a way."
